{"id":"drache","lemma":"Drache","pos":"noun","rank":4395,"glosses":["dragon","kite (with the sense of \"toy for children\" or \"geometrical shape\")"],"ipa":"/ˈdʁaxə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/95/De-Drache.ogg/De-Drache.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Drachen","plural":"Drachen","feminine":"Drachin"},"examples":[{"text":"Der Drache ist ein Fantasiewesen.","en":"The dragon is an imaginary creature.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Drachen steigen lassen kann gefährlich sein.","en":"Flying a kite can be dangerous.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/29384","words":[null,{"g":"to ascend"},{"g":"to allow"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"dangerous, hazardous"},{"g":"to be"}]},{"text":"Er ließ einen Drachen steigen.","en":"He flew a kite.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/64984","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to allow","l":"lassen"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null,{"g":"to ascend"}]},{"text":"Ich habe dir einen Drachen gekauft.","en":"I bought you a kite.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null,{"g":"to buy, to purchase","l":"kaufen"}]},{"text":"Gibt es wirklich Drachen?","en":"Are dragons real?","words":[{"g":"to give","l":"geben"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"really, actually"},null]}]}